{
  "id": "463",
  "title": "Don't Be Angry",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2018-02-28",
  "synopsis": "Little He discovers that Lili is angry at him.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/669/37e89ce716679d885d0c2727f112d13498607131.mp3?1589791880",
  "series": {
    "title": "Ben’s life in China 4: Trouble in Paradise",
    "chapter": 24,
    "totalChapters": 29
  },
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "别生气了，好吗？\n\n小何：丽丽，我今晚有空，我们去看电影吧！\n丽丽：不去。\n小何：那我们一起去吃饭吧！\n丽丽：不想去。\n小何：那你想干什么呢？\n丽丽：我什么都不想干。\n小何：怎么了？生气了？\n丽丽：哼！\n小何：真的生气啦？怎么了？\n丽丽：上次看电影，你迟到，还先走了！\n小何：啊！那件事啊！对不起，对不起，那天真的公司有事。别生气了，好吗？\n丽丽：工作重要，还是我重要？\n小何：当然是你重要。我努力工作，也是为了你啊。",
    "traditional": "別生氣了，好嗎？\n\n小何：麗麗，我今晚有空，我們去看電影吧！\n麗麗：不去。\n小何：那我們一起去吃飯吧！\n麗麗：不想去。\n小何：那你想幹什麼呢？\n麗麗：我什麼都不想幹。\n小何：怎麼了？生氣了？\n麗麗：哼！\n小何：真的生氣啦？怎麼了？\n麗麗：上次看電影，你遲到，還先走了！\n小何：啊！那件事啊！對不起，對不起，那天真的公司有事。別生氣了，好嗎？\n麗麗：工作重要，還是我重要？\n小何：當然是你重要。我努力工作，也是為了你啊。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Don't be angry, alright?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小何：丽丽，我今晚有空，我们去看电影吧！",
      "traditional": "小何：麗麗，我今晚有空，我們去看電影吧！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé lì lì wǒ jīn wǎn yǒu kòng wǒ men qù kàn diàn yǐng ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: Lili, I'm free tonight. Let's go watch a movie!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "丽丽：不去。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：不去。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì bú qù",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: I'm not going."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小何：那我们一起去吃饭吧！",
      "traditional": "小何：那我們一起去吃飯吧！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé nà wǒ men yì qǐ qù chī fàn ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: Then let's go have a meal together!"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "丽丽：不想去。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：不想去。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì bù xiǎng qù",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: I don't want to."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "小何：那你想干什么呢？",
      "traditional": "小何：那你想幹什麼呢？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé nà nǐ xiǎng gàn shén me ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: Then what do you want to do?"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "丽丽：我什么都不想干。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：我什麼都不想幹。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì wǒ shén me dōu bù xiǎng gàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: I don't want to do anything."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "小何：怎么了？生气了？",
      "traditional": "小何：怎麼了？生氣了？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé zěn me le shēng qì le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: What's up? Are you angry?"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "丽丽：哼！",
      "traditional": "麗麗：哼！",
      "pinyin": "lì lì hēng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Humph!"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "小何：真的生气啦？怎么了？",
      "traditional": "小何：真的生氣啦？怎麼了？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé zhēn de shēng qì la zěn me le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: You're really angry? What's wrong?"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "simplified": "丽丽：上次看电影，你迟到，还先走了！",
      "traditional": "麗麗：上次看電影，你遲到，還先走了！",
      "pinyin": "lì lì shàng cì kàn diàn yǐng nǐ chí dào hái xiān zǒu le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Last time when we went to the movies, you were late, and then left before me!"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "simplified": "小何：啊！那件事啊！对不起，对不起，那天真的公司有事。别生气了，好吗？",
      "traditional": "小何：啊！那件事啊！對不起，對不起，那天真的公司有事。別生氣了，好嗎？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé a nà jiàn shì a duì bu qǐ duì bu qǐ nà tiān zhēn de gōng sī yǒu shì bié shēng qì le hǎo ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: Ah, that! Sorry, sorry. That day I really had to work. Don't be angry, alright?"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "simplified": "丽丽：工作重要，还是我重要？",
      "traditional": "麗麗：工作重要，還是我重要？",
      "pinyin": "lì lì gōng zuò zhòng yào hái shi wǒ zhòng yào",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Which is the most important, work or me?"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "simplified": "小何：当然是你重要。我努力工作，也是为了你啊。",
      "traditional": "小何：當然是你重要。我努力工作，也是為了你啊。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé dāng rán shì nǐ zhòng yào wǒ nǔ lì gōng zuò yě shì wèi le nǐ a",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: Of course you are more important. The reason I work hard is because of you."
    }
  ],
